{
  "method": "Per-beat TTS (avocado_v2:briggs, speed 130 after first pass at 100 was 39.552s raw). Each beat trimmed of leading/trailing silence (<-38dB approx, 0.06s pad), concatenated with 0.14s gaps, 0.25s head, 0.45s tail at 48kHz mono. Word timings interpolated within each beat proportional to word character length \u2014 trial approximation, not STT.",
  "total_seconds": 29.772,
  "beats": [
    {
      "beat": 1,
      "text": "Twelve cowboys nearly bounced a river bridge into the water, just by walking in perfect time.",
      "start": 0.25,
      "end": 3.977,
      "duration": 3.727
    },
    {
      "beat": 2,
      "text": "Texas, eighteen eighty-three. Eli, their leader, was proud of his rhythm.",
      "start": 4.117,
      "end": 7.622,
      "duration": 3.505
    },
    {
      "beat": 3,
      "text": "He crossed first. Tap, tap, tap.",
      "start": 7.762,
      "end": 9.103,
      "duration": 1.341
    },
    {
      "beat": 4,
      "text": "Behind him, every boot landed together.",
      "start": 9.243,
      "end": 11.365,
      "duration": 2.122
    },
    {
      "beat": 5,
      "text": "The bridge began to bounce, gently, then like a clothesline in a storm.",
      "start": 11.505,
      "end": 14.873,
      "duration": 3.368
    },
    {
      "beat": 6,
      "text": "A chain sang. A plank jumped. Eli's hat sailed into the river.",
      "start": 15.013,
      "end": 18.448,
      "duration": 3.435
    },
    {
      "beat": 7,
      "text": "Luckily, the cowboys stayed dry. Unluckily, the fish kept the hat.",
      "start": 18.588,
      "end": 21.566,
      "duration": 2.979
    },
    {
      "beat": 8,
      "text": "A steady beat feeds a bounce, like pushing a swing at the same moment, every time.",
      "start": 21.706,
      "end": 25.318,
      "duration": 3.611
    },
    {
      "beat": 9,
      "text": "So cowboys learned to cross out of step. Eli still keeps perfect time, on dry land.",
      "start": 25.458,
      "end": 29.322,
      "duration": 3.865
    }
  ],
